SY_TALK("WnXTwOHFe6Q",[[0,["Shri Fatima Puja, St Georges, Switzerland,","14 August 1988."]],[2,["Today we are going to have a  puja of Fatimabi,"]],[7,["who was the symbol of Gruhalakshmi,"]],[12,["and so we are going to have the puja"]],[15,["of the Gruhalakshmi principle within us."]],[21,["As the housewife has to finish every work,"]],[25,["everything in the household, and then she goes for a bath,"]],[29,["in the same way this morning, I had to do lots of things"]],[33,["and then I could come for your puja,"]],[37,["because today the house wife’s jobs were many."]],[40,["So I had to finish them like a good house wife."]],[47,["Now, the principle of Gruhalakshmi"]],[53,["has been evolved and developed by the Divine,"]],[58,["it’s not a human being’s creation"]],[64,["and as you know it resides in the Left Nabhi."]],[71,["The Gruhalakshmi is the one that is represented in the life of Fatima"]],[77,["who was the daughter of Mohammed Saheb."]],[84,["Now She is always born in a relationship"]],[90,["to a Guru, which is of virginity, of purity."]],[99,["So She comes as sister or"]],[103,["She comes as a daughter."]],[109,["Now the beauty of Fatima’s life is"]],[113,["that after the death of Mohammed Saheb,"]],[118,["as usual, there were fanatic people who thought they can take"]],[126,["the religion into their hands"]],[128,["and can make it a very fanatic thing."]],[133,["The attention was not paid so much"]],[136,["towards the ascent of the person."]],[140,["Even Mohammed Saheb has described his son in law in many ways."]],[145,["And He is the only one -"]],[147,["or there’s another incarnation- of Brahmadeva,"]],[153,["who came on this earth. Ali came on this earth,"]],[156,["He was the incarnation of Brahmadeva"]],[158,["and his - another incarnation was Sopandeva","[brother of Jnaneshwara],"]],[164,["which, you can go to Pune,"]],[167,["you can see the temple of Sopandeva there."]],[203,["So we have Ali and his wife Fatima"]],[208,["who incarnated on the principle of the Left Nabhi."]],[217,["She stayed in her house, in her household"]],[222,["and She observed what you call"]],[226,["a kind of a panda","[? Pata: veil]"]],[230,["or niqab as they call it, to cover her face."]],[237,["It is a symbol that a woman"]],[240,["who is a housewife has to"]],[249,["save her chastity by covering her face because"]],[256,["She was a beautiful woman and"]],[261,["They were born in a country which was very, very violent"]],[268,["and She would have been definitely attacked"]],[272,["in case She had not lived in that kind of fashion."]],[276,["As you know, in the time of Christ,"]],[280,["though Mary was Mahalaxmi’s incarnation,"]],[284,["had to be very, very potential personality"]],[288,["and Christ did not want anybody to know what She was."]],[295,["But though She was in the house, She was Shakti,"]],[299,["so She allowed her sons"]],[305,["or actually ordered them"]],[309,["to fight those fanatics"]],[312,["who were trying to deny the authority of her husband."]],[319,["And you know that  Hasan and Hussain, they were killed there."]],[323,["It’s a very beautiful thing how"]],[327,["the Mahalaxmi Tatva of Sita"]],[330,["took a form of Vishnumaya"]],[337,["just to establish the beautiful principle of"]],[347,["a housewife."]],[352,["Now, She was very powerful, no doubt,"]],[356,["and She knew that her children will be killed."]],[361,["But these people are never killed,"]],[364,["they never die nor do they suffer."]],[368,["It’s a drama they had to play to show people how stupid they are."]],[372,["As a result of that,"]],[378,["another system started where they respected saints;"]],[383,["like in India Shiya people respect Auliyas"]],[389,["or we can call them the people"]],[392,["who are Realized souls like Nizamuddin Saheb."]],[395,["Then we have got “Chisti”."]],[400,["We have got, in Ajmer, Hajrat Chisti."]],[406,["All these great Saints were respected by Shiyas."]],[410,["But still they could not transcend"]],[415,["the limits of religiosity."]],[422,["So they also became extremely fanatic."]],[426,["Firstly they would not see to"]],[432,["another religion where they had saints."]],[436,["They would not respect the saints who belonged to another religion"]],[441,["and even when we had a great saint"]],[448,["like Sai Nath of Shirdi, who was a Muslim to begin with,"]],[455,["and it is said that Fatima herself brought him"]],[460,["as a child in her lap and gave him to some lady."]],[466,["We did not deny,"]],[470,["as far as Hindus were concerned,"]],[474,["his saintliness, but the Muslims did not accept it."]],[480,["There's another one who is called Haji Malang, who is very near"]],[484,["Bombay, who was a realised soul."]],[487,["He, too, realised the fanaticism of the Shias."]],[493,["`Shia' word comes from Siya;"]],[496,["in U.P. Sita is called as Siya."]],[500,["Sitaji is called as `Siya'."]],[504,["They also did not realise that there are saints who are not,"]],[511,["so called, Muslims but they are saints."]],[515,["So they could not get out of it."]],[518,["So we have another one called Haji Malang"]],[521,["who was worshipped by Hindus."]],[525,["Some Muslims also go there, no doubt."]],[531,["This Haji Malang"]],[534,["was quite worried about the fanaticism of the Shias,"]],[539,["so he appointed some Hindus to worship him,"]],[543,["just to counter balance."]],[546,["They did all kinds of things."]],[548,["There are many saints like that."]],[552,["I went to Bhopal. There is another big saint who was buried [there]."]],[558,["But his all disciples were just depending on the earnings"]],[565,["of that place, which was very bad. Even"]],[568,["Hazrat Nizamuddin's things are the same way as the Hindus do."]],[573,["They all make an earnings,"]],[575,["I mean it's a kind of a commercial business."]],[580,["So this saint died and was buried there."]],[586,["There were many people who were depending on it."]],[588,["When I went there, I just, by the way, asked them,"]],[593,["'What is your religion?'"]],[596,["So they said 'We are Muslims'."]],[598,["I said what 'Was the religion of that saint who died?'"]],[601,["He said 'Saints have no religions.'"]],[605,["So I said 'Then why do you want to follow religion?","Why don't you follow his religion?'"]],[609,["They have no religions."]],[613,["Even, it is said, in Sanskrit,  the Sanyasis have no religions."]],[617,["They are dharmatita, they go beyond the religion."]],[622,["But as it has happened with every incarnation,"]],[624,["it has happened even with the Shia people, with the Sunnis,"]],[628,["with the Hindus, with the Muslims and everyone,"]],[631,["that they made a fanatic group."]],[634,["Now fanaticism itself is absolutely against religion,"]],[640,["against your innate religion within your-self"]],[643,["because it creates poison."]],[648,["It's a venomous thing."]],[651,["It makes you hate others."]],[654,["When you start hating others,"]],[657,["then it reacts in you as horrible poison"]],[661,["which eats up all that is beautiful within you."]],[669,["Hating any one"]],[672,["is the worst thing that human beings can do, but they can do it."]],[676,["They can do whatever they like.","Animals do not hate any one."]],[679,["Can you imagine? They don't know how to hate."]],[682,["They bite some one because that is their nature."]],[685,["They cut some one because that's their nature."]],[687,["They never hate someone."]],[690,["They may not like someone but this hatred, which is a poison,"]],[694,["is a speciality of human conception"]],[699,["and human absorption. Only human beings can hate."]],[705,["And this horrible thing hatred"]],[709,["was settled between even the Muslims which was not done."]],[713,["This Karbala was not created for hatred, but for love."]],[719,["Everything that was done for love was converted into hatred,"]],[723,["in every religion."]],[727,["Now the worst part of the whole thing is,"]],[730,["that one part which hates thinks the other part is the worst of all,"]],[737,["and the another part thinks that the first part is the worst of all."]],[743,["Under what rule, law or logic they decide -"]],[748,["that is their own lookout. So they club together like that."]],[755,["While this principle of the Gruhalakshmi was specially created"]],[761,["to overcome that hatred,"]],[764,["to subdue that icy stuff called hatred,"]],[770,["to remove, from the minds of the people, hatred -"]],[773,["this Gruhalakshmi principle was created."]],[778,["How? In the family when you have a household,"]],[787,["the Gruhalakshmi principle has to subdue the hatred"]],[794,["between the children, between the husband and the children."]],[801,["But if she herself enjoys her hatred"]],[806,["then how can she subdue it?"]],[809,["She is the source of that peace which subdues hatred."]],[814,["Now in India we have joint family [system], you too have"]],[818,["relations like uncles, aunties, this that."]],[821,["But the housewife's job is to smooth"]],[827,["smooth out all angularities of people which create friction."]],[838,["Now the man has to worship a housewife."]],[841,["It is said so, 'Yatra Narya Pujyante, Tatra Ramante Devata'-"]],[845,["'wherever the housewife is respected,"]],[849,["there only the Gods reside'."]],[855,["In our country, I, must say credit must go to the housewives"]],[860,["because we are no good for economics,"]],[862,["no good for politics, administration. Hopeless."]],[866,["Men folk are useless,"]],[867,["they don't know any household work or anything,"]],[870,["women have kept it to themselves, but our society is first class,"]],[874,["is maintained by the women of the household."]],[879,["So the man has to respect the housewife, that's very important."]],[885,["If he does not respect his housewife, there's no possibility"]],[889,["of any Gruhalakshmi tattva being maintained."]],[894,["It's like the preservation of that"]],[902,["principle of a housewife."]],[908,["But some men, I mean many of them,"]],[911,["think that it is their birth right to ill-treat their wives,"]],[917,["to torture them, to say all kinds of things,"]],[921,["to be angry,  if she is a good woman."]],[926,["But if she is a nagger, if she is a bhoot,"]],[929,["then they are subdued, completely subdued."]],[931,["If the wife is a bhoot then husband always, sort of,"]],[935,["tries to please her and be extremely kind to her."]],[940,["He knows she is a bhoot, after all, you know, be careful"]],[945,["[you] don't know what time the bhoot will come like a snake on you!"]],[949,["And if she knows how to nag or to argument,"]],[953,["then also they are afraid. There's no love,"]],[955,["they have no love or respect for each other"]],[957,["but they have an awe or fear."]],[962,["And they are afraid of such a woman."]],[965,["Now some women think if they become flirtish then","the husbands are better controlled."]],[971,["But their basic principle they lose."]],[975,["The basic shakti that they have, they lose,"]],[981,["and they land up in difficulties."]],[984,["So the basic principle of a Gruhalakshmi"]],[988,["is to respect her chastity,"]],[993,["to respect her chastity outside, inside."]],[999,["That is the steadiness of her."]],[1001,["Of course most of the men take advantage of it."]],[1005,["If the wife is docile or obedient,"]],[1009,["they make it a point that they just rule the wife, left and right.","Alright!"]],[1017,["But this woman, the housewife,"]],[1022,["has to know that she is not docile."]],[1027,["She is obedient to her own righteousness,"]],[1033,["to her own virtues, to her own qualities."]],[1039,["If the husband is stupid, alright,"]],[1042,["he's stupid like a child, finished!"]],[1045,["But the husband has to know that he must"]],[1048,["respect, otherwise he is a lost case, he's finished,"]],[1053,["he's good for nothing."]],[1057,["First thing is that he must see"]],[1060,["that the woman in the household is respected as a Gruhalakshmi."]],[1065,["Then the blessings flow."]],[1067,["But in no way he should insult her"]],[1073,["or be unkind to her"]],[1076,["and raise his voice or say things to her."]],[1080,["But the wife has to be the one who is to be respected."]],[1086,["I have so many times said, your wife is dominating,"]],[1089,["give her two slaps on the face, of course, no doubt."]],[1093,["She has not to be dominating,"]],[1096,["she has to remove the dominating forces of others."]],[1101,["She is the source of peace,"]],[1105,["she is the source of joy"]],[1108,["and she is the peacemaker."]],[1111,["If she is the one who creates problems,"]],[1115,["then you can slap her nicely, bring her to her shape, is alright."]],[1121,["So this Gruhalakshmi tattva is mutual."]],[1125,["It doesn't depend only on the wife or husband but both of them."]],[1129,["So once if you are making your wife suffer,"]],[1135,["your left Nabhi can never improve."]],[1141,["Or if you are a bad wife your left Nabhi cannot improve."]],[1147,["Now in the west the problem with women"]],[1150,["is this that they don't realise as to what is their power."]],[1159,["An eighty year old woman also would like to look like a bride."]],[1164,["They do not feel their dignity","and enjoy their dignity within themselves."]],[1169,["They are the queen of the house"]],[1172,["but they want to behave like [a] cheapish, childish,"]],[1176,["young frivolous girl."]],[1179,["They do not feel the dignity of their being,"]],[1183,["they talk too much, they behave in a manner"]],[1188,["that, does not behove a housewife."]],[1192,["Like they'll take out their hands, talk like this,"]],[1195,["as the fisherwomen do, when they sell their fish to someone"]],[1199,["and when they have to fight."]],[1202,["Or they shout sometimes, they shout also, I mean,"]],[1206,["I heard they shout and sometimes they beat their husbands,","that's the limit!"]],[1214,["They start always comparing themselves"]],[1218,["with the husband, to begin with."]],[1220,["Like I am such a rich man's daughter,"]],[1225,["I am from such and such family, my husband is from such a"]],[1228,["low family he has no money,"]],[1231,["nothing, he's not educated, so ill-treat him."]],[1234,["Treat him in a manner that so no respect."]],[1237,["Such a woman will lose all her powers."]],[1243,["Also in her own ways"]],[1248,["she will feel guilty,"]],[1250,["she'll feel guilty because, first of all, nobody has right"]],[1254,["to look down upon any one whatsoever in Sahaja Yoga specially."]],[1259,["Then, to look down upon your husband, is something unbelievable."]],[1267,["He may not be a Sahaja Yogi. Alright."]],[1271,["He may not be up to the point, but by your behaviour,"]],[1275,["by your strength, by everything"]],[1281,["you can save him. But why are you losing yourself"]],[1286,["by dominating others, by strangling others,"]],[1292,["by making your husband a very, sort of a,"]],[1299,["frog in the well."]],[1303,["Telling him, 'Oh, we both are after all we should enjoy."]],[1307,["Lets have our house separately,"]],[1309,["nobody should come in the house'.","Even a rat won't enter that house."]],[1314,["Even to say, 'Oh, these are my children, my husband, myself',"]],[1321,["is the negative of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1325,["is the negative form of understanding."]],[1329,["These are absolutely absurd things,"]],[1332,["they do not look like, of any Sahaja Yogi or any sahaja yogini."]],[1339,["All this kind of selfishness,"]],[1342,["all this kind of seclusion is against Sahaja Yoga."]],[1349,["But a thing of a housewife is,"]],[1352,["'Oh, now how much should I prepare?'"]],[1356,["For example, 'There will be 50 persons coming.'"]],[1360,["So the husband says 'But only 10 are coming."]],[1362,["Why do you want to have for 50 persons ?'"]],[1365,["'But may be they would like to eat more.'"]],[1368,["'But then why do you have 50 plates?'"]],[1371,["'Maybe they might bring there friends.'"]],[1374,["So she thinks of her generosity."]],[1378,["She enjoys her generosity."]],[1380,["I have known many like that."]],[1382,["Though they are not even Sahaja Yoginis."]],[1387,["They will say 'Will you come, sister in law,"]],[1389,["will you come for dinner?'  'Oh, I am not coming,"]],[1391,["you cook too many things.' 'Not coming?"]],[1394,["No, no, I'll cook very few things but please come.'"]],[1397,["Then she just start thinking immediately."]],[1399,["'What vegetables are available in the market?"]],[1402,["What should I get? What is the best?'"]],[1404,["I mean, I am not their Guru, I am not their mother,"]],[1409,["I am just a relation,"]],[1412,["but they want to express their love through the food,"]],[1416,["they are the giver of food - Annadha . They are the Annapurnas"]],[1422,["and this is one of  the quality,"]],[1425,["the generosity for woman doesn't have"]],[1427,["she is not a sahaja yogini, by any chance. Take it from me."]],[1432,["Husband may be little miserly, doesn't matter,"]],[1438,["but wife has to be very generous"]],[1441,["and sometimes, she secretly gives money,"]],[1445,["not to her own children but to others."]],[1450,["Such beautiful women have to be there in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1456,["But I feel so sorry, sometimes"]],[1459,["that the attack comes from the women of Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1466,["not from the men, on me. I'm a woman myself,"]],[1470,["and I feel shocked that women should attack me like this, for what?"]],[1478,["In Sahaja Yoga there is no domination of any kind"]],[1481,["but all these so called ideas of servility or domination comes"]],[1486,["from the false ideas you have, about your own dignity,"]],[1492,["about your own understanding."]],[1495,["You are not aware of yourself."]],[1499,["You do not know that you are the queen, nobody can dominate you."]],[1504,["Who can dominate the lady, who rules the household?"]],[1511,["If supposing the husband says, 'I don't like this colour!'"]],[1513,["Alright, leave it for a while."]],[1515,["Then somebody will come and say 'What a nice colour!'"]],[1518,["'Ah, such a nice colour, oh, don't change it.'"]],[1522,["The women must understand the men."]],[1526,["They have big eyes. They are not microscopic."]],[1531,["They see everything in a big way, you see."]],[1534,["So today they will say something, tomorrow they will forget about it"]],[1539,["and they don't have microscopic eyes."]],[1541,["They are too above these things."]],[1543,["They are above these things. You must understand that!"]],[1548,["But if he sits on the horse, 'I must also sit on the horse","and fall down."]],[1553,["If he goes for skiing - I'll also go for skiing."]],[1557,["If he develops his muscles - I'll also develop my muscles.'"]],[1562,["It is coming to that point."]],[1565,["I mean women start looking like nothing on earth."]],[1568,["You don't know what sort of women these are with big, big muscles"]],[1571,["without any moustaches."]],[1578,["So this kind of stupid ideas we have."]],[1582,["But there is no subordination of any kind."]],[1584,["You are subordinated to your own dignity,"]],[1587,["to your own chastity, to your own sense of honour"]],[1590,["and, above all, to your righteousness"]],[1594,["because you are in charge of that. The man who is in charge,"]],[1599,["has to look after that side."]],[1603,["How many quarrels you create?"]],[1605,["How can you be quarrelsome","when you are supposed to become the peacemaker?"]],[1609,["Supposing we send two peacemakers"]],[1612,["to some country to make peace and they cut each other's throat,"]],[1617,["what will you say to such a thing?"]],[1621,["You are the one who has to smooth down every thing,"]],[1626,["you have  the one who has to bring such"]],[1631,["expression of love, such sweet things"]],[1638,["that the family itself feels rested in you, secured"]],[1645,["because you are the mother."]],[1647,["The family must feel secured within you"]],[1651,["and this love is your power."]],[1657,["This is your power that you can give love"]],[1660,["and giving love you will find, you will always enrich yourself."]],[1666,["I mean imagine what presents I give compared to what I get."]],[1669,["I don't know I'll have to build another house!"]],[1672,["I am telling them \"Don't give me individual present."]],[1674,["I will not take any individual presents.\""]],[1676,["Now still despite that. I don't know,"]],[1679,["just with love if I get something with care, that love, you know,"]],[1686,["itself manifests and comes back to you like a poetry."]],[1690,["You are some times surprised."]],[1694,["I'll give you one simple example of my own life"]],[1698,["which will tell you how love can work it out."]],[1702,["I was a housewife to begin with and to end with, I think."]],[1706,["And once I was in Delhi,"]],[1709,["my daughter was to be born, so I was knitting something for her,"]],[1714,["sitting outside in the lawn,"]],[1716,["when three persons walked into the house, one lady and two men"]],[1720,["and they came and said, \"See now we are..."]],[1722,["housewife, I am a housewife and these two are,"]],[1726,["one is my husband and he is the friend of my husband"]],[1729,["and he is a Muslim,"]],[1730,["and we have come to you for shelter because we are refugees.\""]],[1734,["I looked at them, they looked very good to Me,"]],[1736,["they were quite alright."]],[1738,["I said, \"Alright you please settle down in my house.\""]],[1741,["So I gave them the outside room which had a kitchen"]],[1744,["and a bathroom and this thing,"]],[1746,["and for the gentleman, I said, \"There is another spare room,"]],[1749,["you can stay there, and husband wife can stay here.\""]],[1752,["In the evening my brother came in."]],[1754,["He started shouting at the top of his voice,"]],[1756,["he said \"What is this?"]],[1757,["You don't know these people, they may be thieves,"]],[1760,["they may be this, they might do this...[UNCLEAR]"]],[1764,["my husband came, he also joined him"]],[1766,["because, you see, they were friends!","He told you"]],[1770,["All men just the same, you see,"]],[1772,["so he said, \"You see, she doesn't understand"]],[1775,["she has kept these three persons here."]],[1777,["God knows, what they are, saying refugees, this thing."]],[1780,["She doesn't know, he's a Muslim, he's a Hindu."]],[1782,["God knows, she's two husbands, one husband\" like that,"]],[1786,["all kind of things."]],[1789,["Next morning they forgot about that."]],[1791,["I said \"Alright. Let them be there for one night. Is alright?"]],[1795,["I can't drag them out today, one night.\""]],[1797,["Next morning they forgot that they where living there."]],[1799,["That's like men!"]],[1801,["First day, such a blasting, such a blasting,"]],[1803,["I said \"Alright, one night. Now don't shout. They will feel hurt."]],[1806,["So let them stay one night, they'll be soothed down.\""]],[1810,["Next morning they went away for their work."]],[1812,["They had no time. It was, you see,"]],[1815,["only on a weekend they become active in the household,"]],[1819,["otherwise they are inactive. So they went away."]],[1823,["It so happened that these people stayed with me for one month."]],[1827,["Then this lady got a job"]],[1831,["and she went away with her husband and this Muslim."]],[1837,["But in the meanwhile there was a big riot in Delhi, very big riot"]],[1842,["Because many Hindus and Sikh people were killed in Punjab."]],[1849,["It had a reflection in Delhi"]],[1851,["and they started killing all the Muslims there."]],[1854,["So, three, four Sikh people and one or two Hindus came to my house"]],[1858,["and they said \"We are told that you have a Muslim staying with you.\""]],[1862,["I said, \"No. How can I have?\""]],[1864,["They said, \"There is a Muslim. We have to kill him.\""]],[1867,["I said \"See I am wearing such a big teeka (bindi),","can you believe it"]],[1870,["that I could have a Muslim in the house?\""]],[1873,["They thought I must be a real Hindu fanatic, you see!"]],[1880,["So they believed me. I said, \"See now,"]],[1883,["if you have to go in my house, you'll go on my dead body"]],[1886,["because I will not allow you!\""]],[1887,["So they felt quite frightened. They went away."]],[1890,["So this fellow heard My things and he came and he said,"]],[1895,["\"I'm surprised. How did you risk your life?\""]],[1897,["I said, \"There is nothing. Nothing.\""]],[1900,["His life was saved."]],[1901,["Now this gentleman, this Muslim gentleman,"]],[1904,["became a great poet called Sahir Ludhianvi,"]],[1909,["and this lady became a great actress,"]],[1912,["Kai nau ahe tenza?","(What is her name?)"]],[1914,["the one who used to act like a mother?"]],[1918,["Ha, Sachadev, Achala Sachadev."]],[1922,["I knew it was, they had become one day and all that."]],[1925,["But I didn't tell anybody about it."]],[1927,["I said \"Now supposing they come to know, I am in Bombay,"]],[1931,["they will just go mad about Me,\""]],[1932,["and I said \"I have no time for all that.\""]],[1935,["So, we started a film centre for the young people,"]],[1940,["to give them some good films."]],[1941,["But it all made into a farce, later on."]],[1944,["They never listened to Me, but whatever it is."]],[1947,["So they said \"We should get this Achala Sachadev to act as a mother\""]],[1951,["I said \"Alright ,but don't tell her"]],[1953,["I have said, I have anything to do with it.\""]],[1957,["So, years had passed, about I think about twelve  years or so."]],[1964,["So they went and told her. So she was fussing like an actress."]],[1967,["\"No, no - how much are you going to pay me? I cannot act free."]],[1969,["Everybody will ask for free. Then how can I give you free."]],[1972,["You will have to give me Sari."]],[1974,["You'll have to give so much money. This thing.\""]],[1976,["They said \"Alright come to the muhurat at least."]],[1978,["Come to the muhurat\", to the beginning,"]],[1979,["big muhurat is the one where you start it."]],[1983,["So she came and I was there. She looked at Me"]],[1986,["and just, you know, she couldn't believe"]],[1989,["that she has seen Me after twelve years."]],[1990,["The tears starting swelling her eyes."]],[1993,["Absolutely she couldn't say anything, just she came and"]],[1996,["fell into my arms"]],[1999,["and she said \"Where were you last all these days?"]],[2002,["I have been trying to trace you out.\""]],[2005,["Then she started describing Me and all."]],[2008,["Then Sahir Ludhianvi was there and he said,"]],[2011,["\"How this Lady is here?\" They said, \"This is Her work.\""]],[2014,["\"Oh God, why didn't you tell us? You see,"]],[2017,["we'll give our lives for Her!\""]],[2019,["And they were all amazed, how they were changed."]],[2022,["\"No money, nothing, I am going to give money for this project."]],[2025,["Nothing doing. \""]],[2026,["See now,"]],[2027,["I was a housewife just an ordinary housewife."]],[2031,["I didn't have so many rights on"]],[2035,["my husband's property, or anything,"]],[2039,["and my brother another dominating fellow,"]],[2041,["both of them put together,"]],[2044,["just were about to kill me that night,"]],[2047,["with their temper and anger. I soothed them down"]],[2051,["and then you know when I told my husband"]],[2053,["and my brother, they were amazed."]],[2056,["I said, \"They are the ones who have become like this"]],[2058,["and see the change,"]],[2060,["how much they have...\","]],[2063,["and they said, \"No more, we are going to say"]],[2066,["no to any charitable institution."]],[2068,["This is the last mistake we have committed!\""]],[2070,["And the whole idea of a..."]],[2076,["earning and money just toppled down."]],[2081,["And she has acted in many films for charity"]],[2085,["and this Ludhianvi also wrote many things for charity."]],[2092,["So a woman can make a man a charitable personality -"]],[2098,["because she herself is charitable."]],[2101,["She has so many beautiful..she's an artist!"]],[2105,["And she can create beauty around her,"]],[2107,["in her household, in her family, in her society."]],[2111,["Everywhere. But no!"]],[2113,["Women want to fight like men. They will have associations."]],[2117,["They would have called that [UNCLEAR]"]],[2124,["[UNCLEAR]"]],[2126,["unions, unions  they will like to have unions to fight for that."]],[2134,["I agree that some of the men have been extremely cruel,"]],[2137,["some of the laws have been extremely cruel, this thing, that thing,"]],[2141,["and that they have to be told."]],[2144,["But this is not the way!"]],[2146,["There is another way of improving these men, who try to"]],[2153,["destroy the women,"]],[2155,["because women have one very great quality that Ganas are with them"]],[2162,["and Shri Ganapati is with them."]],[2165,["He will never side with men if they are chaste"]],[2168,["and do not try to show off their body"]],[2171,["and show off their beauty and want to make,"]],[2174,["sort of, a capital out of it."]],[2180,["Such women are extremely powerful,"]],[2185,["extremely powerful, and they show their valour"]],[2188,["when it comes to anything"]],[2189,["like we had Jhansi ki Rani. She was an ordinary housewife."]],[2193,["She fought the British."]],[2195,["And the British also"]],[2197,["were surprised at her valour and they said that"]],[2200,["we had got Jhansi, alright,"]],[2202,["but the glory goes to the Queen of Jhansi."]],[2208,["Like that we had many, Noorjahan we had,"]],[2210,["we had Ahilya Bai. We had many great women in India"]],[2214,["because of these institutions. Padmini we had,"]],[2218,["Chand Bibi. There's so many women we can mention"]],[2221,["who have been great women, who were housewives."]],[2228,["So the woman's qualities are like the potential of the mother earth"]],[2235,["or potential of any energy."]],[2237,["Like electricity has its potential somewhere else."]],[2240,["You see the lights here, makes no difference,"]],[2242,["one light or two lights, but the potential is important."]],[2247,["So one has to understand that we are potential"]],[2249,["and to preserve our potential we must have the sense of dignity,"]],[2253,["honour and righteousness within ourselves."]],[2256,["Now men must respect their women who are like this."]],[2260,["But men are another stupid stuff"]],[2263,["because they will not respect a woman"]],[2266,["who loves them, who is chaste,"]],[2268,["who is good, who wants them to become collective,"]],[2272,["who wants them to give, who be charitable,"]],[2275,["who wants that Sahaja Yoga should be promoted"]],[2279,["and the one who wants that her husband should be happy"]],[2282,["and joyous and that he should come to Sahaja Yoga as well."]],[2286,["Instead of that they run after some funny, stupid women."]],[2293,["What is there to be so attracted towards bhootish women,"]],[2299,["must be some bhoots in them, I don't know,"]],[2302,["that the way they get attracted."]],[2304,["As a result of all this misbehaviour of men,"]],[2307,["women become very insecure"]],[2309,["and they get insecured. As a result,"]],[2312,["the men suffer and women suffer."]],[2316,["A man who neglects his wife, and treats like that,"]],[2320,["will consequently get blood cancer."]],[2333,["And the woman who behaves like this,"]],[2337,["in this manner and if she ill-treats"]],[2342,["her husband, will get asthma"]],[2346,["or of a very serious type of cirrhosis,"]],[2354,["could be brain damage, could be paralysis,"]],[2359,["could be complete dehydration of the body."]],[2367,["Because left nabhi is so important."]],[2371,["If the left Nabhi is made hectic, as you know"]],[2375,["by your running about and by jumping about and by being hectic,"]],[2380,["that left Nabhi becomes hectic and you develop blood cancer."]],[2385,["I have always seen"]],[2386,["that the women who are thin, their husbands as jittery - why?"]],[2393,["Because the wife is all the time making him run up and down."]],[2395,["\"Do this, do that, you didn't bring this thing for me!"]],[2398,["I had asked you to bring the Coca-cola you didn't bring!"]],[2401,["You didn't do that!\" As if he's the sinner all the time."]],[2403,["And the man becomes jumpy all the time, jumpy."]],[2408,["He gets something for the jumping"]],[2412,["and she gets something for her torturing."]],[2416,["There's no love. There's no joy. There's no happiness."]],[2424,["This so-called figure madness,"]],[2427,["which is now subsiding, thank God. It's coming from America now."]],[2431,["It's subsiding. This figure madness makes you funny."]],[2439,["Women have to be settled down women."]],[2443,["They have to be Grahasthis,"]],[2445,["that is, 'The one who settles in the household'."]],[2448,["Said to be satisfied with her household."]],[2450,["If she is all the time running about,"]],[2452,["she doesn't want to stay in the house"]],[2454,["then she is not a housewife, but she is a maid servant."]],[2461,["There is a saying that there was a lady who was a maid servant,"]],[2466,["and then she was made a housewife"]],[2468,["but she could not stop her running about"]],[2471,["because she was a maid servant."]],[2474,["She doesn't settle in the household."]],[2477,["Now for whom is the household, is not only for herself,"]],[2481,["No, not for her husband, no, not for her children"]],[2484,["but for others to welcome."]],[2487,["Like this Mother Earth has spread all these beautiful things for you"]],[2490,["to come and sit and enjoy."]],[2494,["But is a very common thing, also that in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2496,["we find that people, after marriage,"]],[2499,["become absolutely engrossed into each other and lose Sahaja Yoga."]],[2505,["Then their children suffer. Their children become fussy, funny"]],[2509,["and disobedient, torturesome."]],[2513,["They have some physical problems also - is a punishment."]],[2519,["Not that I punish this,"]],[2521,["but it is your own nature that punishes - supposing you"]],[2523,["put your hand in the fire, it will burn."]],[2526,["I mean who is punishing? You are punishing yourself!"]],[2532,["Then children become funny."]],[2537,["Just for your family, just for your food,"]],[2539,["just for your household, this selfishness,"]],[2544,["if it crawls up into man, then God save that family."]],[2547,["If it's a woman, its alright, at least a little bit"]],[2551,["but if the man is a gone case,"]],[2557,["that I should have a house, I should have a job,"]],[2559,["I should look after my children, it's for my family."]],[2564,["Our family is not of one man one woman"]],[2569,["but the whole universe is our family."]],[2574,["We are not on our own,"]],[2577,["and if you become arbitrary, and if you become secluded."]],[2581,["I must tell you one thing and warn you today"]],[2584,["that-  those people who will try to seclude themselves,"]],[2587,["a day will come,"]],[2589,["when they will have horrid diseases on them don't blame Sahaja Yoga!"]],[2594,["Sahaja Yoga has it's own beautiful realm of God's Kingdom."]],[2599,["But in the God's Kingdom, you have to be collective."]],[2605,["But a bad wife can create problems because she's..[INAUDIBLE]"]],[2610,["and she'll create a problem she'll form a group of people,"]],[2613,["group of women,"]],[2615,["she'll go on rolling down with her bhoots to everyone."]],[2626,["Or may be she's very conscious of her education"]],[2629,["may be conscious of her position or of her money and all that -"]],[2633,["then also she will try to keep the husband aloof."]],[2640,["Such people have to pay for what they have done."]],[2644,["Not because it is a punishment from God."]],[2650,["So Gruhalakshmi tattva in Sahaja Yoga is very important."]],[2656,["Those people who have got problems after coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2661,["most of them have neglected their Gruhalakshmi principle."]],[2669,["Because Gruhalakshmi, if it goes out, then centre heart catches."]],[2675,["Those women who have tried such tricks,"]],[2679,["should give up immediately because it's very indignified."]],[2682,["Nobody respects such a woman."]],[2686,["It's very true with the leaders' wives and the leaders."]],[2690,["The leader's wife or the leadership"]],[2692,["is a minimal of a minimal of a minimal  of a so-called position."]],[2701,["Most insignificant."]],[2705,["What you got is much higher than this."]],[2711,["If you ask a saint to become a king. He'll say, What?"]],[2717,["You want to put the ocean into a cup?"]],[2725,["Is the minimal of minimal."]],[2727,["Is the lowest of lowest."]],[2729,["Those who think their life is service are another stupid people."]],[2735,["Their life is enjoyment, not service."]],[2739,["But that service itself is enjoyment."]],[2744,["But if you just keep to service."]],[2746,["\"Oh, I am sacrificing, this is my tapasya!\" Finished!"]],[2751,["Then you end up like a tapasvi,","with like a beanstalk [figure] - thin."]],[2757,["You can be used for a cross!"]],[2764,["So, in Sahaja Yoga it is enjoyment but,"]],[2767,["unless and until you have that essence"]],[2771,["of enjoyment into everything, it cannot be an enjoyment."]],[2776,["If you take out the essence from the cane sugar"]],[2782,["or what you call the sugar cane bamboo,"]],[2787,["then what is left?"]],[2790,["In the same way, all the so-called service"]],[2793,["and seva and tapasya"]],[2795,["and all that has no sweetness in it,  finished."]],[2801,["So the essence of all this is sweetness"]],[2805,["and that is generated by women."]],[2810,["But they are very strict. \"Don't spoil this."]],[2812,["Keep this nice, keep that nice.\""]],[2815,["The husband comes home like as if like a criminal, you know."]],[2823,["He has to be like a bull in a china shop, he has to be."]],[2828,["It's a good thing in a way."]],[2831,["Is nice, how he doesn't know anything, is even better for you."]],[2840,["But to make him all the time slave,"]],[2842,["\"Do this! You didn't do this for me! Do that for me!\","]],[2845,["Is not the job of a housewife!"]],[2851,["Her job is like the Mother Earth. Does She complain?","Nothing."]],[2858,["She gives you everything."]],[2859,["So much is the sustenance in [UNCLEAR]. So dignity."]],[2863,["Such powers She has."]],[2865,["What does She care for anybody giving her anything?"]],[2868,["You will be amazed if I tell you today, till today, till yesterday,"]],[2872,["I never asked my husband to buy me anything."]],[2876,["For the first time I asked him to buy me a camera,"]],[2880,["and you see the result, in the evening what he said."]],[2883,["Least expected!"]],[2887,["Never in life-time."]],[2890,["He used to say, \"You must tell me what you want\"."]],[2892,["First time, I said something and see the effect."]],[2894,["Because I've never said to him!"]],[2900,["So such a woman has to be self-satisfied,"]],[2903,["satisfied within herself because she has to give."]],[2906,["The person who has to give, how can she demand?"]],[2909,["She has to give love because she is love."]],[2912,["She has to give all the services."]],[2915,["She has to give all the possessions;"]],[2917,["she has to sooth down. What a responsibility, I tell you,"]],[2920,["what a responsibility!"]],[2923,["More than a Prime Minister, more than any king or anyone,"]],[2926,["is the responsibility of a woman,"]],[2928,["and she should feel proud of it,","that such a responsibility has come to me."]],[2932,["A housewife"]],[2934,["has much more responsibility than a leader of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2938,["But the wives of leaders can be horrid"]],[2944,["because they think they have become leaders."]],[2946,["I mean, this is the minimal of minimum."]],[2948,["I mean it's like, I said, the ocean coming into a little cup."]],[2954,["And their behaviour becomes so funny and absurd, I am surprised."]],[2958,["I was married in a family where we had 100 people living together"]],[2966,["and each one of them adores Me."]],[2970,["If I go somewhere in Lucknow,"]],[2973,["all of them will come from all over to see  me"]],[2975,["but My husband goes, nobody comes to see him.","He always complains."]],[2979,["He's the relation, I am not the relation,","and they come and see me, not him!"]],[2986,["If I had not given them love,"]],[2988,["if I had not given them whatever they wanted"]],[2991,["they would have not come to Me."]],[2994,["So they are the preservers, preservers of others."]],[2999,["They don't have to preserve things for themselves."]],[3004,["And we have many stupid women with us, I tell you,"]],[3007,["many stupid women."]],[3009,["We call them buddhu (idiot) in Hindi language, the buddhus."]],[3015,["Because they don't know what power they have got."]],[3021,["They don't know what responsibility they have."]],[3026,["I'm an example before them."]],[3033,["And this is the very big problem with Me that practically"]],[3037,["I think 60% leaders have horrible wives."]],[3040,["I must say, horrible."]],[3045,["And Sahajayoga goes dhap like that with them."]],[3049,["They can't live in an ashram,"]],[3051,["they will have their food,","the husband must see that they have their food."]],[3054,["But it is they who have to feed everyone,"]],[3057,["everybody has to be looked after and at the end they should eat."]],[3064,["Everybody must get a bed, they must see everybody is sleeping now,"]],[3068,["they must cover all the children, everything, then they must sleep."]],[3074,["But no, they sit down,"]],[3075,["they become mini-matajis or greater-than-matajis."]],[3078,["\"Get me this thing! Get me that!"]],[3081,["Just do that! Do this!\""]],[3087,["They don't know how to cook, most of them."]],[3091,["Every wife of a leader"]],[3095,["has to cook and learn cooking. It's compulsory now."]],[3105,["They have to cook. And with heart."]],[3108,["They should be able to cook and give with love to others."]],[3113,["That's the minimum of Annapurna."]],[3117,["And the husband shouldn't find faults with them."]],[3121,["In the beginning they might make mistakes then encourage."]],[3124,["Encourage their qualities, encourage their goodness,"]],[3127,["encourage their niceness."]],[3130,["Also I have seen, some very good ladies"]],[3132,["who were taking very active life in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3135,["After marriage they are lost."]],[3136,["Husbands are also supposed to be Sahaja Yogis - lost."]],[3142,["Sometimes they appear, sometimes if I am there they come,","otherwise they are not there."]],[3147,["Today I was asking Arneau,","he told Me so many of them are like that here."]],[3151,["That means there's something wrong with the husbands"]],[3156,["because before marriage they were better off."]],[3160,["So how much it is important, a Gruhalakshmi Principle within us,"]],[3165,["for us to be together,"]],[3167,["to us to grow together, to feel the togetherness,"]],[3170,["all the time, the oneness that is within us."]],[3173,["So yesterday, as I told you, that I'll tell you about"]],[3177,["the Ragas we have."]],[3179,["Ra is energy."]],[3181,["Ga is in Sanskrit language ‘Ga - Geti’ (ग गेती )  means 'which penetrates',"]],[3185,["'which moves into everything',"]],[3188,["it's the etheric qualities,"]],[3192,["etheric, into which you see,"]],[3194,["you put anything in the ether and  you can receive it anywhere."]],[3198,["So the Raga, is the energy which goes into ether"]],[3204,["and touches your spirit."]],[3208,["That is the Raga."]],[3210,["And these Ragas, I would say are something like a housewife."]],[3221,["Supposing if you stand with a military band"]],[3225,["you will be fed up, \"left right, left right, left right\"."]],[3230,["But a beautiful melody that's a melodious thing, melody."]],[3234,["And this melody itself is suggestive of a beauty."]],[3241,["The way the housewife decorates the house,"]],[3245,["she smoothes down everyone, makes them feel happy."]],[3249,["then she's looking after everyone."]],[3251,["Everybody knows she is standing there."]],[3253,["Imagine, like a modern style would be, you call"]],[3258,["some people for birthday cake of your child"]],[3261,["and you cut the cake first"]],[3265,["because you are the housewife."]],[3267,["How will it look? It is that ridiculous, I tell you."]],[3272,["The way the housewife always puts forward before everybody else."]],[3275,["They have to be on the back because you have to look after."]],[3281,["Look after all of them,"]],[3284,["and this is what is a Raga is."]],[3289,["It caters to all your angularities."]],[3293,["Supposing a person is very upset and worried,"]],[3297,["comes from office, sits down, puts on a Raga."]],[3300,["It soothes you down."]],[3303,["It makes you settle down."]],[3306,["Like people come home for five days, live like"]],[3312,["I don't know, what to call, not even hotels,"]],[3315,["and live in a tent-like thing"]],[3318,["and the sixth day they are out at the sea"]],[3322,["or they go and stay in a hotel."]],[3324,["Nobody wants to stay in the house"]],[3327,["because there is no Gruhalakshmi principle between the two."]],[3333,["But Raga needs better this  sitting down, settling down."]],[3337,["Unless and until you settle down, you cannot enjoy Raga."]],[3340,["Imagine somebody listening to a Raga when he's a jumpy."]],[3346,["So, one has to settle down"]],[3348,["and that settling down is what is the work of a woman"]],[3354,["who is a housewife,"]],[3356,["and the man has to act, is to settle down."]],[3360,["As I have told you many a times how your left Nabhi goes out"]],[3364,["in the modern times, much more,"]],[3366,["and many children are also born of the women who are hectic."]],[3371,["Is that the wife..."]],[3374,["normally in India before, you see,"]],[3377,["the husband used to get up, have his bath,"]],[3379,["all the time his wife is not with him."]],[3382,["She is cooking for him. She is looking after the children."]],[3385,["All the time sticking on to husband also is a sign of boredom."]],[3390,["Husband gets bored, the wife gets bored,"]],[3392,["then they have a divorce."]],[3395,["So must have other interests like looking after the children,"]],[3398,["household, Sahajayoga, things like that."]],[3401,["Then he comes from the bath, he sits,"]],[3405,["sits on the ground, in India."]],[3407,["Now we are sitting on the tables, all right,"]],[3410,["at least sit on the tables, not on the table, but on the chair."]],[3413,["Then she doesn't tell him at this time \"Why did you do like this?\""]],[3419,["Or  \"This lady was quarrelling\""]],[3421,["or \"I met another lady she was telling me you were this"]],[3424,["and you were that.\" No! She says \"Let him eat his food\"."]],[3428,["That's why in India"]],[3429,["if husband has to show temper he doesn't eat"]],[3432,["his food in the house or he will wash his underclothes himself."]],[3439,["That is how, they show their temper."]],[3441,["So then she fans the husband slowly"]],[3444,["and tells him good things, \"You see, today you know why?"]],[3448,["My son got up and he said \"I love my father very much\"."]],[3453,["He said  \"Really?\" \"Yes, yes, he said, he said so\"."]],[3456,["And husband knows she is telling lies also,"]],[3463,["but you see all nice things, you see,"]],[3465,["and \"I think better your mother is much better now."]],[3468,["I think I'll go and look after your mother."]],[3471,["And your sister is coming."]],[3472,["So I think you are buying a Sari for her.\""]],[3475,["All such nice - nice thing she will talk to him."]],[3477,["So he eats his food nicely then he go washes his hands"]],[3481,["and goes in a bullock cart, not in a car"]],[3484,["where there is a jam, always."]],[3487,["Alright, now the bullock cart is over, the fan is over."]],[3493,["You have to be very fast. Life is fast now."]],[3496,["In this fast thing, as I have told you,"]],[3499,["that on the periphery of the"]],[3502,["wheel you have the speed"]],[3505,["but at the axis it is not.","So the Sahajayogis have to be at the axis,"]],[3510,["and so the husband and the wife,","the left and the right side of a chariot"]],[3515,["have to be on the axis"]],[3517,["and the left is left and the right is right."]],[3521,["Now the women always take more time to get ready."]],[3523,["Not Me, I take less than My husband,"]],[3526,["much less than My husband, but normally. So, that is their habit."]],[3531,["Forget it. Now women have their own habits."]],[3535,["They are women. Women will remain women, men will remain men."]],[3538,["Men must see their watches ten times."]],[3541,["Women might see it once or may be","their watches are lost or out of order -"]],[3546,["if they are real women."]],[3548,["They are not jumpy like men, they are different type."]],[3551,["But they are women and you are men,"]],[3555,["and God has made men and women."]],[3558,["If it was to make a unisex,"]],[3560,["He would have made unisex, He did not."]],[3564,["So one must accept the sex is which you are born,"]],[3567,["with grace and beauty and dignity - both."]],[3572,["And you must know this is Woman's party!"]],[3575,["In India we have these things like, you know,"]],[3578,["I was married in a family,"]],[3582,["very orthodox where they used to even cover the face and all that."]],[3585,["So, one day, the collector, is the friend of My husband,"]],[3588,["so, he told My elder brother-in law that, why not the wife of"]],[3592,["my friend come and see Me."]],[3595,["So he said, \"Of course! of course!\" So just to make it easy for Me"]],[3601,["he took leave from his office and disappeared into another town"]],[3604,["and told his wife that \"See that She goes and sees the collector\"."]],[3608,["See how beautiful it was,"]],[3614,["how beautiful it was,"]],[3618,["and I never felt that he was dominating Me"]],[3621,["because after all that was the system of that family,","alright, its alright."]],[3627,["But for this what you need is pure Intelligence."]],[3632,["If the husband is a dullard he'll bring down his wife."]],[3636,["If the wife is a dullard she'll bring down the husband."]],[3639,["If a woman is very smart, talks well and you know she knows how to"]],[3644,["talk and impress people doesn't mean that she is very intelligent."]],[3648,["I call that person the most intelligent who sees the benevolence,"]],[3655,["the ascent and the ultimate goal."]],[3660,["That person is the most sensitive,"]],[3664,["is the most intelligent."]],[3666,["All other intelligence is avidya, is useless."]],[3670,["Now, on this subject I think I can write a book,"]],[3672,["so, is better leave it to the book,"]],[3674,["and today let us have the puja"]],[3676,["May God Bless You."]],[3678,["Any questions?"]],[3685,["This means, I'll be spending some money!"]],[3689,["I don't know, there's no chance! I don't know when will I spend."]],[3693,["I love to spend, I mean, everybody should love to spend."]],[3695,["That's why the money is for."]],[3697,["Must give to others, you see."]],[3699,["Why the matter is there? Matter is to give to others."]],[3701,["Just enjoy giving others."]],[3704,["So enjoyable, to give something to others."]]]);
